            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.15.25+1KI.15.26+1KI.15.27+1KI.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 15.25-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki Solomon aiturrur ilpayiani loo Siraeli, o lukuny pooki oo loshon, o lukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye too ltung'ana loo Siraeli, te Yerusalem, pee epuo aailepunye osanduku lo lning'o lo sotua lo Laitoriani aaitupuku te nkanasa e Daudi, aa taa Sion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrurro iltung'ana pooki loo Siraeli te dukuya olaiguanani to sirua lo lapa liopishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu ilpayiani pooki loo Siraeli, nenap ilawi ilo sanduku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyau ilo sanduku oilo ng'obor le ntumo, o nena masaa naasinya pooki naatii atua ilo ng'obor; neyau ilapolosak o Lawi ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olaiguanani Solomon o lturrurr pooki le Israel apa oiturrurre te dukuya ninye, netii dukuya ilo sanduku, nepolos nkerra kumok o lmong'i lemeikenayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eyautua ilapolosak ilo sanduku lo lning'o lo sotua lo Laitoriani ewueji enye, tiatua olgilata liatua leina aji, tiatua ine wueji nesinya aisul, tiabori inaipuko oo lkerubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kelak apa lelo kerubi inaipuko enye te shumata ilo sanduku lo lning'o lo sotua, neaku keitoip lelo kerubi ilo sanduku lo sotua, o mbokishi enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaadoru apa nena bokishi oleng, ometaa ore ineeiting'ie nelioyu teine wueji sinyati te dukuya olgilata liatua osinya. Kake melioo te boo. Netii ninche ine ometabaiki ena olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 10.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Metii apa toki atua ilo sanduku meteleku ake nena baoi dapashi oo soito apa naatipika Musa te Horeb, teine apa naitobirie Olaitoriani olning'o lo sotua o ltung'ana loo Siraeli, apa pee eipang'u te nkop e Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
