                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa esiaai apa oo lakutak loo ntarumpetani, o laranyak pee eitoning'oo ate te nkirukoto o sinkolio eisis neisho enashe Olaitoriani. Naa teneilepieki osinkolio too ntarumpetani o too nkinantani dapashi, o kulie ake kinantani naaranyishoreki eisisi Olaitoriani, aajo, “Eisupat ninye nebik enyorrata enye nauno ntarasi” ore ina aji, ina aji o Laitoriani neiput enkatampoi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
